Thesis patch of FAST_LIO (ROS2 branch, cc3c9e8): reliable cloud QoS, M3DGR Mid-360 config,
LiDAR-only mode (common.imu_en false), mapping.nn_every_iter, the ground-vehicle constraint and a ring bounds check
in the Velodyne handler, IMU subscription depth 2000.
